WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Demo 1: The same CI check keeps failing across PRs.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Two pull requests. The same unit-tests check fails on both.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:11.000
Explore: search the skill catalog for CI failure.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:16.000
See what it produces and what it can access before it runs.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:19.000
Try it once on the demo repo. Ask for a draft pull request.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:29.000
The report traces both failed jobs to one bug in checkout.py.

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:38.000
The draft subtracts the discount. unit-tests passes.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:48.000
Schedule it. A second draft adds the job to .secondshift.yaml.
